      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guarded transitions\n\nEach service checks the current status\nbefore it changes it. Anything else is\nrejected with 409 Conflict\n(invalid_status_transition).\n\nEvery transition is written to\nAssetHistory and the audit log.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
